		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4757&amp;p=35124#p35124"><![CDATA[
DMR ID database is separate from Digital Contacts<br><br>This is the same on all most DMR Radios, not just OpenGD77<br><br>DMR ID database is only to show the callsign and name etc of the station being received (Rx)<br><br>Digital Contacts are used for Tx e.g. TG and Private Calls.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Jan 12, 2025 10:30 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
